### Campus Library Manager - API Tests
### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/campus-library

### ==========================================
### 1. BOOKS
### ==========================================

### Get all books
GET {{baseUrl}}/books

###

### Get book details - Clean Code
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/detail?id=1

###

### Get book details - Effective Java
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/detail?id=2

###

### Get book details - Refactoring
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/detail?id=3

###

### Get book details - Non-existing book
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/detail?id=999

###

### Get book details - Invalid ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/detail?id=abc

### ==========================================
### 2. AUTHORS
### ==========================================

### Get all authors
GET {{baseUrl}}/authors

###

### ==========================================
### 3. ADD BOOK
### ==========================================

### Get add book form
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/add

###

### Add a new book - Robert C. Martin
POST {{baseUrl}}/books/add
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

title=Spring in Action&pages=520&authorId=1

###

### Add another book - Joshua Bloch
POST {{baseUrl}}/books/add
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

title=Java Concurrency in Practice&pages=384&authorId=2

###

### Add another book - Martin Fowler
POST {{baseUrl}}/books/add
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

title=Patterns of Enterprise Application Architecture&pages=560&authorId=3

###

### ==========================================
### 4. VERIFY ADDED BOOKS
### ==========================================

### Get all books after adding new books
GET {{baseUrl}}/books

###

### Get details of newly added book
### Assuming this is the fourth book
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/detail?id=4

###

### Get details of fifth book
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/detail?id=5

### ==========================================
### 5. NAVIGATION
### ==========================================

### Application home page
GET {{baseUrl}}/

###

### Books page
GET {{baseUrl}}/books

###

### Authors page
GET {{baseUrl}}/authors
